{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:984f8eb107836b82","name":"Asteroid Field Escape","source":{"id":"source:reference-984f8eb107836b82","title":"Asteroid Field Escape","revision":15984,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:29Z","sha256":"4f44cca4cd5065856e85e22b256148239f61b3321d3886a651310824a3fd536d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15984","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Asteroid%20Field%20Escape&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-984f8eb107836b82","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," represents a chase sequence through an asteroid field. The heroes, aboard their ship, are attempting to escape from pursuing enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},". This challenge is intended for use during a combat encounter, giving the crew of the ship something to work toward while the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," fend off the enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Asteroid Field Escape Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 1 (5 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Fire ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," 23):"]}," A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," aboard the heroes' ship can fire a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"}," (which must deal at least 2d10x2 points of damage) to clear a path through the asteroid field."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Physical Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Physical_Sciences)"}," (DC 18):"]}," The heroes can attempt to use their knowledge of asteroid field physics to determine the safest route through the field."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," (DC 23):"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," aboard the ship can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to boost the strength of the ship's shields against an incoming asteroid collision, blunting or negating the impact."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," (DC 28):"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of the ship can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to keep the pursuing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," at bay and make it safely through the asteroid field."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Catastrophic Failure"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Catastrophic_Failure","referenceId":"reference:8e66c70d3771541a"},":"]}," Any hero making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to control the ship who fails the check by 10 or more earns two Failures instead of one."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degrees of Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degrees_of_Success","referenceId":"reference:5059731ee2f0416b"},":"]}," The heroes' progress through the asteroid field makes it harder for the pursuing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," to avoid the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"},". Each time the heroes earn a Success, one of the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her next attack roll made before the end of his or her next turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:563191d8a5e759b3"},":"]}," The heroes must act in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Order"}," during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes evade the pursuing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and make it safely through the asteroid field.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The heroes' ship is shot down or damaged by asteroids, crash-landing on one of the largest asteroids in the field.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
